{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/page,_N_T_/"},"routeCache":{"key":"/route-cache/APP_PAGE/c6377dd9ce6a1c2cd100eb4344e843eb4639b9ed26f84643f77680e9eb454c4b/$/index","owner":{"kind":"APP_PAGE","sourceRoute":"/page"},"isFallback":false}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--8TviIQ64WTuA0L_8KunFD--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/assets/vercel-symbol-white.svg\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/8cfad07b4ed31a72.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-4a462cecab786e93.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-b1e2483a7e02feee.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-5995a2c610855a49.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-8eb134ecd1897591.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/page-9be72daf29d69ed4.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>GTM Play Router - Unofficial Concept</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"From what your best rep does, to what every rep does. As a system. An independent concept for Vercel GTM Engineering.\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header><img src=\"/assets/vercel-symbol-white.svg\" alt=\"Vercel\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\"/><h1>GTM Play Router</h1><span class=\"meta\">Unofficial concept · Sample data</span></header><main class=\"wrap\"><section class=\"hero\"><p class=\"meta-label\">For Vercel GTM Engineering</p><h2 class=\"display\">From what your best rep does, to what every rep does. As a system.</h2><p class=\"lede\">The GTM Engineer role exists to build AI apps and workflows that drive revenue, and to ship top performers&#x27; best practices to the org as systems. This is that system, built on your own stack: a Next.js app routing every GTM signal through a real AI SDK agent on the Vercel AI Cloud, with the reasoning attached to every decision. This is where I think the issue is, this is how I have solved it before, and this is how I would solve it for you.</p><div class=\"beats\"><div class=\"beat\"><p class=\"beat-label\">The issue</p><p class=\"beat-title\">Best practices die in transit</p><p class=\"beat-body\">A top performer&#x27;s best practice lives in their head and their sent folder. By the time it reaches the org, the deal it would have saved is gone.</p></div><div class=\"beat\"><p class=\"beat-label\">Before</p><p class=\"beat-title\">How I have solved it</p><p class=\"beat-body\">At Corgi I ran product operations and built the internal systems the team worked from. Before that I founded a company and ran its operations end to end.</p></div><div class=\"beat\"><p class=\"beat-label\">For you</p><p class=\"beat-title\">How I would solve it</p><p class=\"beat-body\">Route every GTM signal to the right motion with a real AI SDK agent loop, turn observed top-performer behavior into a shipped, auditable play, and keep the reasoning attached to every decision.</p></div></div><p class=\"sample\">Sample data throughout. Independent concept, not affiliated with or endorsed by Vercel.</p></section><section class=\"section\"><h3 class=\"section-title\">Signals in. Systems out.</h3><p class=\"note\">Signals come in from Sales, Success, Marketing and Data. Pick one, route it, and watch an anecdote become a system with its reasoning attached. The routing call is live: it hits an AI SDK route on this deployment.</p><div class=\"stat-strip\"><div class=\"stat\"><p class=\"stat-value\">0</p><p class=\"stat-label\">Signals routed</p></div><div class=\"stat\"><p class=\"stat-value\">0</p><p class=\"stat-label\">Plays shipped to the org</p></div><div class=\"stat\"><p class=\"stat-value\">0.0<!-- -->m</p><p class=\"stat-label\">Session age</p></div></div><div class=\"console\"><div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"ph\">Incoming signals</div><div class=\"signals\"><div class=\"sig\"><div class=\"src\">Sales</div><div class=\"txt\">Champion who ran our last AI Cloud POC just moved to a new account that is not a customer.</div></div><div class=\"sig\"><div class=\"src\">Success</div><div class=\"txt\">Enterprise trial account has gone quiet for nine days at the security review stage.</div></div><div class=\"sig\"><div class=\"src\">Marketing</div><div class=\"txt\">Webinar attendee from a target account asked three questions about SOC 2 and regional infrastructure.</div></div><div class=\"sig\"><div class=\"src\">Data</div><div class=\"txt\">v0 Team workspace usage tripled week over week; seat count unchanged.</div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"ph\">Routed decision</div><div class=\"detail\"><div class=\"empty\">Select a signal on the left, then route it.</div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><h3 class=\"section-title\">Running on Vercel, visibly</h3><p class=\"note\">Everything below is actually wired in this deployment, not a mockup.</p><div class=\"sys\"><div class=\"sys-row\"><p class=\"sys-name\">AI SDK + Vercel AI Gateway</p><p class=\"sys-role\">The routing brain</p><p class=\"sys-desc\">Each &quot;Route this signal&quot; click POSTs to /api/route-signal, which calls a model through the Vercel AI Gateway with structured output: motion, reason, confidence, typed and logged.</p><div class=\"term\"><div class=\"tline dim\">Route a signal above and the live call appears here.</div></div></div><div class=\"sys-row\"><p class=\"sys-name\">Next.js App Router</p><p class=\"sys-role\">This app</p><p class=\"sys-desc\">Server-rendered shell plus this interactive router, served from the edge. Deployment: <span class=\"mono\">http://localhost:3000</span></p></div><div class=\"sys-row\"><p class=\"sys-name\">Vercel Analytics + Speed Insights</p><p class=\"sys-role\">The measurement layer</p><p class=\"sys-desc\">@vercel/analytics and @vercel/speed-insights are mounted in the root layout. Page views and Web Vitals for this session are being collected right now.</p></div><div class=\"sys-row\"><p class=\"sys-name\">Preview deployments</p><p class=\"sys-role\">The workflow</p><p class=\"sys-desc\">Every push to the GitHub repo ships a preview deployment; production is just the main branch. That is how GTM iterations would get reviewed by Sales, Success, Marketing and Data, on real links.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><h3 class=\"section-title\">How a GTM Engineer would grow this</h3><p class=\"note\">The next iteration, on the same platform.</p><div class=\"sys\"><div class=\"sys-row\"><p class=\"sys-name\">v0</p><p class=\"sys-role\">The play surface</p><p class=\"sys-desc\">Play drafts rendered as generated UI from the observed-behavior template, reviewed before anything ships to the org.</p></div><div class=\"sys-row\"><p class=\"sys-name\">Workflows</p><p class=\"sys-role\">Durable routing</p><p class=\"sys-desc\">Long-running intake workflows that wait on human review before a play ships, instead of firing in one request.</p></div><div class=\"sys-row\"><p class=\"sys-name\">Observability</p><p class=\"sys-role\">The audit trail</p><p class=\"sys-desc\">Vercel Observability across the agent loop: every classification typed, logged and replayable, exactly like the audit feed below.</p></div><div class=\"sys-row\"><p class=\"sys-name\">Web Analytics</p><p class=\"sys-role\">The proof</p><p class=\"sys-desc\">Play performance, signal to meeting and signal to order, tracked so the org sees which shipped plays actually drive revenue.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><h3 class=\"section-title\">Nothing routes without a reason</h3><p class=\"note\">Every classification, every drafted action, every shipped play, on record, with the model route that produced it.</p><div class=\"panel\"><div id=\"audit\"><div class=\"row\"><time>10:20</time><span>Router session opened. Intake live for Sales, Success, Marketing and Data.</span></div></div></div></section></main><footer><img src=\"/assets/vercel-symbol-white.svg\" alt=\"Vercel\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" class=\"ftri\"/><p><b>GTM Play Router</b>, an independent concept by Ayo Ahmed. Synthetic data. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Vercel.</p><p class=\"mono stack-line\">Next.js · AI SDK · Vercel AI Gateway · Vercel Analytics · Speed Insights · <!-- -->http://localhost:3000</p><p class=\"attr\">Vercel, the Vercel design, Next.js and related marks, designs and logos are trademarks or registered trademarks of Vercel, Inc. or its affiliates in the US and other countries.</p></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></template><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-4a462cecab786e93.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[7025,[\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-8eb134ecd1897591.js\\\"],\\\"Analytics\\\"]\\n5:I[1130,[\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-8eb134ecd1897591.js\\\"],\\\"SpeedInsights\\\"]\\n6:I[1959,[],\\\"ClientPageRoot\\\"]\\n7:I[1726,[\\\"974\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/page-9be72daf29d69ed4.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\na:I[4431,[],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[5278,[],\\\"AsyncMetadataOutlet\\\"]\\ne:I[4431,[],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\n10:I[4431,[],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\n11:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\n13:I[7150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/8cfad07b4ed31a72.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"b\\\":\\\"8TviIQ64WTuA0L_8KunFD\\\",\\\"p\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\"